{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39471902",
      "title": "Reusing Animation States",
      "sourceHash": "239f020cb3b34c6c0cf2df18f644529d745e1564a1c359b31c85a7dbbacb5163",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.87,
          "end": 3.45,
          "en": "With that button finished here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.45,
          "end": 7.62,
          "en": "Let's go back to this modal. Here in this modal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.62,
          "end": 10.14,
          "en": "we previously added the initial animate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.14,
          "end": 13.14,
          "en": "and exit animation states.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.14,
          "end": 14.88,
          "en": "And as you might notice,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.88,
          "end": 19.143,
          "en": "the initial and exit animation, of course, is the same here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.58,
          "end": 22.53,
          "en": "Now we could therefore of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.53,
          "end": 27.53,
          "en": "add a constant here where we have our hidden animation state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 29.34,
          "end": 30.739,
          "en": "or however you wanna call it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.739,
          "end": 34.117,
          "en": "and store this object in this constant.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.117,
          "end": 37.8,
          "en": "And then just reuse this constant here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.8,
          "end": 40.157,
          "en": "so that if we ever wanna make changes here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.157,
          "end": 42.27,
          "en": "we just have to make those changes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.27,
          "end": 44.583,
          "en": "in one place instead of two places.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.17,
          "end": 49.41,
          "en": "And with that, you will see that we still got this entry",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.41,
          "end": 54.41,
          "en": "and access animation, but there also is another way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 54.66,
          "end": 59.66,
          "en": "of reusing a certain animation value or animation state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 61.02,
          "end": 61.853,
          "en": "And for that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 61.853,
          "end": 66.002,
          "en": "you can add the variance prop to your motion component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 66.002,
          "end": 67.74,
          "en": "And I will say right away",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 67.74,
          "end": 71.52,
          "en": "that the main idea behind variance is a different one",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 71.52,
          "end": 74.34,
          "en": "which we'll explore in the next lecture.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 74.34,
          "end": 78.36,
          "en": "But nonetheless, this variance prop indeed also useful",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 78.36,
          "end": 82.35300000000001,
          "en": "for defining and reusing certain animation states.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 83.64,
          "end": 85.74,
          "en": "For this variance takes an object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 85.74,
          "end": 89.07,
          "en": "But now it's not such an animation object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 89.07,
          "end": 93.9,
          "en": "but instead an object where you set any keys of your choice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 93.9,
          "end": 95.943,
          "en": "For example, a key named hidden.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 97.28999999999999,
          "end": 98.52000000000001,
          "en": "And then the value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 98.52000000000001,
          "end": 102.453,
          "en": "for that key will again be such an animation object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 103.41,
          "end": 106.22999999999999,
          "en": "And with that, we're defining a custom identifier",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 106.22999999999999,
          "end": 108.815,
          "en": "and then the animation state that should be applied",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 108.815,
          "end": 111.99000000000001,
          "en": "if this identifier is targeted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 111.99000000000001,
          "end": 115.743,
          "en": "And you will soon learn how to target such an identifier.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 117.47999999999999,
          "end": 120.93,
          "en": "Now here, besides hidden, I'll also add another variant",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 120.93,
          "end": 122.4,
          "en": "called visible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 122.4,
          "end": 125.19,
          "en": "Though as mentioned, these names are up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 125.19,
          "end": 128.373,
          "en": "And that will be this animation state here for me.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 130.32,
          "end": 133.29,
          "en": "And you can now target these different variants",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 133.29,
          "end": 136.17000000000002,
          "en": "and apply those animation states here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 136.17000000000002,
          "end": 139.975,
          "en": "by using these variant identifiers as values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 139.975,
          "end": 142.773,
          "en": "for initial animate or exit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 143.85,
          "end": 146.49,
          "en": "So here for initial, I can set this to hidden.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 146.49,
          "end": 149.64,
          "en": "For animate, I can set this to visible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 149.64,
          "end": 152.163,
          "en": "And for exit, I can again set this to hidden.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 154.71,
          "end": 157.41,
          "en": "And of course, these keys here have to be the keys",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 157.41,
          "end": 158.55,
          "en": "you're using here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 158.55,
          "end": 161.583,
          "en": "So you have to make sure that you don't have any typos here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 163.07999999999998,
          "end": 164.73,
          "en": "But with that, you've got an easy way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 164.73,
          "end": 169.11,
          "en": "of defining those variants once and of then reusing them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 169.11,
          "end": 172.38,
          "en": "And you can also reuse them with while hover and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 172.38,
          "end": 174.434,
          "en": "So this would also be possible, though",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 174.434,
          "end": 178.02,
          "en": "of course, this here makes no sense for this modal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 178.02,
          "end": 180.783,
          "en": "since now it would disappear whenever I hover over it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 181.98,
          "end": 182.837,
          "en": "but it would work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 182.837,
          "end": 186.21,
          "en": "and you therefore see how those variants work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 186.21,
          "end": 188.82,
          "en": "But I'll get rid of while hover now, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 188.82,
          "end": 190.155,
          "en": "And with that, you can see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 190.155,
          "end": 194.16,
          "en": "that this modal still has this entry and exit animation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 194.16,
          "end": 199.16,
          "en": "It works as shown before, but now powered by variants.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 199.23,
          "end": 202.05,
          "en": "Though as mentioned before, the true power",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 202.05,
          "end": 205.82999999999998,
          "en": "of variants comes from another feature which we'll explore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 205.82999999999998,
          "end": 207.003,
          "en": "in the next lecture.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}